ath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-25T09:02:37-07:00","id":1120369,"title":"","content":"Is Second Chances right that we'll be getting a 2e update on Zeky and Irradiation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-25T09:12:36-07:00","id":1120373,"title":"","content":"According to Matt in the comments of the Monday Meeting Notes, they're &quot;a safe assumption&quot;. Or at least the Zeky themselves are, though where they go Irradiation seems reasonably likely to follow.<br /> <br /> Which is really just the finishing blow that guarantees some of my money will be in reserve for this one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I've got a bit of a bad habit of extensively editing my posts after the fact. Please try and bear with me...<br /> In case you're comfortable being more friendly and casual about things, my name's Seren, or Es/Es for short. They/Them or Fae/Faer, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3946-sconce","name":"Sconce","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-25T09:31:27-07:00","id":1120381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"b