con b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1120196-night-horrors-the-tormented?p=1130633#post1130633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, you know what I'd love? More of the weird one-off Prometheans made by supernatural demiurges.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a few supernatural demiurges (and their Prometheans) I'd be interested to see. A mummy trying to make a companion as durable as themselves. A mage who <i>wasn't</i> a mage when they made the Promethean, but whose Awakening was triggered by touching the Divine Fire - and must now deal with the niggling doubt that their greatest feat will always be behind them. An Eternal (from Immortals) who's immortality object was a statue that became a Promethean - the Promethean's bestowment might be that the Eternal's magic also sustains the Promethean past the point where their Azoth would normally burn out - but the Eternal might be actively trying to stall the Promethean's pilgrimmage out of fear that their immortality will end if the Promethean achieves mortality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-18T08:47:31-07:00","id":1130837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div cla